                    <hi rend="grantha">śrīmaN-mahāmaṇḍalīśvaraN Arirā</hi>ya-vi<hi rend="grantha">pā</hi>ṭa<hi rend="grantha">N pāṣai</hi>kku-t ta<unclear>ppu<!--looks like ppamu--></unclear>varāyara kaṇṭaṉ kaṇṭa nāṭu koṇṭu koṇṭa nāṭu kuṭātān pūrva-dakṣiṇa-<hi rend="grantha">paścima</hi>-Ut=tara-catu-samudrādhi-pati y-ī
                    <lb n="2" break="no"/>ḻamum <hi rend="grantha">EmmaṇḍalamuM</hi> koṇṭu <hi rend="grantha">ge<choice><sic>c</sic><corr>j</corr></choice>a</hi>-veṭ=ṭ<hi rend="grantha">ai</hi> <supplied reason="lost">ka</supplied><hi rend="grantha">ṇd-a</hi>ruḷiya <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-vī<hi rend="grantha">rapra<choice><orig>d</orig><reg>t</reg></choice>āpa-kṛṣṇa-mahārā</hi>ya<supplied reason="lost">r</supplied> <hi rend="grantha">pṛthi</hi>vi-<hi rend="grantha">rājyaM</hi> paṇṇi-y-aruḷā niṉṟa <hi rend="grantha">śakāp<choice><orig><unclear>ta</unclear></orig><reg>da</reg></choice>M</hi> <num value="1440"><g type="numeral">1000</g> 4 <g type="numeral">100</g> 4 <g type="numeral">10</g></num> ṉ mēl ce
                    <lb n="3" break="no"/>llā niṉṟa <hi rend="grantha">citrabhā</hi>nu-varu<hi rend="grantha">ṣaM Aṭpaśi</hi>-mā<hi rend="grantha">saM</hi> [muta]l tiyati pūrva-pakṣattu caitya mum Ēkāteciyum siddha-yōgamum peṟṟa bhuda-vārattu nāḷ
                </p>
                <p>
                    Accama[ṟi]yātāṉ [A]laivi[lañ]
                    <lb n="4"/>cātāṉ karutu maracar ta[ru]kama[la]cantiraṉ mukiliṉkaṭ tiriyum Ēval <gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character" precision="low"/> ncaṇṭan puṟṟu marattayum pontukillai Eṉṟa perumāṉ Āṭṭuk kāṉai vaḻaṅkum peru
                    <lb n="5" break="no"/>[mā]ḷ vaḷavaṉ <gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character" precision="low"/> [ma]lāṉ pāṭi-c centamiḻ puṉainta [puṅkavaṉ] <gap reason="lost" quantity="5" unit="character" precision="low"/> koṇṭa perumāḷ Aṟantāṅki y-aracu Ēka-p-perumāḷ toṇṭaimā[ṉ] puttira[n] poṉṉampala[ṅ]
                    <lb n="6"/>[kā]tta toṇṭaimā[ṉ] <hi rend="grantha">kṣe</hi>ṇatayil <gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character" precision="low"/> tun <gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character" precision="low"/> yaṉ tiruk [ko<!--kompu is clear-->ṭu]ṅ-ku[ṉṟa]ttu nam <gap reason="lost" quantity="6" unit="character" precision="low"/>
                    <lb n="7"/><gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character" precision="low"/> <hi rend="grantha">dha</hi>mam Uṭpaṭṭa vakaikku tiru-malai cūḻnta paṟṟil munnāḷ paḻan-tēva-tāṉam-āka <gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character" precision="low"/> cella-p puravi <gap reason="lost" quantity="6" unit="character" precision="low"/>
                </p>
